{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_xinzhao_guard": {
        "ult": "【远程免伤测试版】横扫周围，造成<#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>加目标最大生命值10%的物理伤害，除被挑战的目标（施放对象）外全部<#ef5350ff>击退<>。之后<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内，横扫范围外的敌人对他造成的伤害全部免疫。",
        "skill": "【附加包】冲向目标，对周围敌人造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速30%<>，攻击速度+40%，持续<#ffb900ff>5秒<>。随后<#ff9028ff>三重爪击<>：接下来3次攻击各额外造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>，第三次<#ef5350ff>击飞0.75秒<>。每一下让他别的技能冷却缩短<#ffb900ff>1秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_xinzhao_guard": {
        "ult": "【遠程免傷測試版】橫掃周圍，造成<#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>加目標最大生命值10%的物理傷害，除被挑戰的目標（施放對象）外全部<#ef5350ff>擊退<>。之後<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內，橫掃範圍外的敵人對他造成的傷害全部免疫。",
        "skill": "【附加包】衝向目標，對周圍敵人造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>物理傷害並<#ef5350ff>緩速30%<>，攻擊速度+40%，持續<#ffb900ff>5秒<>。隨後<#ff9028ff>三重爪擊<>：接下來3次攻擊各額外造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>，第三次<#ef5350ff>擊飛0.75秒<>。每一下讓他別的技能冷卻縮短<#ffb900ff>1秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_xinzhao_guard": {
        "ult": "[Test build: far damage blocked] Sweeps around him for <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> plus 10% of the target's max health as physical damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking back<> every enemy but the challenged one. For <#ffb900ff>3s<> afterwards he ignores all damage from enemies beyond the sweep's reach.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Charges the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 30%; he gains 40% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Three Talon Strike<>: his next 3 attacks deal <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> more, the third <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> for 0.75s. Each cuts his other abilities' cooldowns by <#ffb900ff>1s<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_xinzhao_guard": {
        "ult": "[원거리 면역 테스트판] 주변을 휩쓸어 <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> + 대상 최대 체력의 10%만큼 물리 피해를 입히고, 도전받은 대상을 제외한 모든 적을 <#ef5350ff>밀어냅니다<>. 이후 <#ffb900ff>3초<> 동안 휩쓸기 범위 밖의 적에게서 받는 피해를 무시합니다.",
        "skill": "[애드온] 대상에게 돌진해 주변 적에게 <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>의 물리 피해를 입히고 30% <#ef5350ff>둔화<>시키며, <#ffb900ff>5초<> 동안 공격 속도가 40% 증가합니다. 이어서 <#ff9028ff>삼조격<>: 다음 기본 공격 3회가 <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>의 추가 피해를 입히고, 세 번째는 0.75초 동안 <#ef5350ff>공중에 띄웁니다<>. 매 공격마다 다른 스킬 재사용 대기시간 <#ffb900ff>1초<> 감소."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_xinzhao_guard": {
        "ult": "【遠距離無効テスト版】周囲を薙ぎ払い<#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>+対象の最大体力の10%の物理ダメージ、チャレンジ中の対象以外を<#ef5350ff>ノックバック<>。その後<#ffb900ff>3秒<>間、薙ぎ払いの範囲外の敵からのダメージを無効。",
        "skill": "【アドオン】対象に突撃し周囲の敵に<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>の物理ダメージと30%の<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>、攻撃速度+40%（<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）。続けて<#ff9028ff>三槍撃<>：次の3回の攻撃が<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>を追加、3回目は0.75秒<#ef5350ff>ノックアップ<>。1回ごとに他のスキルのクールダウンを<#ffb900ff>1秒<>短縮。"
      }
    }
  }
}
